meta {
  name: Delete the mark
  type: http
  seq: 21
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/attendance/periods/{{markId}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  X-School-Id: {{schoolCode}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 204
}

docs {
  The teardown starts here. Marks go before the days, the days before the
  timetable they were taken against, and all of it before folder 14 deletes
  the pupil and the section underneath.

  Deleting a mark is not the way to correct one - request 12 is. This exists
  for a register taken against the wrong class entirely, where leaving a
  corrected row would still count as a lesson that pupil sat.
}
